#3700
Zone Notes: The Darkwater Hollow~
The Darkwater Hollow, Zone 37. Player level range: 3-13. This zone
preserves the established Midgaard-below topology while changing its
identity into a forgotten hollow of old foundations, flooded ways,
natural caverns, rat warrens, duskwing roosts, smugglers, and black
underground water. Room 3717 remains the handoff to Zone 38 at 3801.
No Western Highway exit is added by this pass; 3746 remains an overlook
until Zone 200 receives its own audited redesign.
~
37 513 0 0 0 0
S
#3701
The Darkwater Crossroads~
Old Midgaard brickwork opens around a natural hollow where four passages
meet above a web of shallow blackwater channels. Iron braces and worn
mason marks show that later city workers forced drains through something
far older. Rat tracks follow the eastern stones, cold air drifts from
the north, and amber lantern soot stains the western arch.
~
