#3702
Beneath the Sealed City Drain~
A broad stone throat climbs toward a barred drain somewhere beneath
Midgaard, but collapsed masonry and an ancient iron grille seal the way
back to the streets above. Runoff murmurs north into the hollow. Old
boot scrapes and newer rat prints share the ledges, proof that this was
once a maintained entrance before the city forgot it.
~
