#3703
The Brick-Sunk Way~
A barrel-vaulted passage bends north through masonry that has settled
unevenly into the hollow. Black water laps over half-buried paving
stones beneath the newer drain channel. The deeper you go, the more the
brickwork gives way to older blocks scarred by claws and old flood
marks.
