#3704
The Gnawed Foundation~
Thousands of tooth marks scar the exposed foundation stones. Several
blocks have been worried loose, revealing warm earthen gaps packed with
fur, cloth, and stolen straw. The hollow smells less like a city drain
here and more like a vast animal den built inside Midgaard's forgotten
bones.
~
