The Gutter Run~
The passage narrows between leaning foundation walls. Shallow runoff
slides along a groove in the floor while chewed boards and small bones
collect on the dry ledges. Ahead, the masonry has been breached from the
other side, and the constant scratching grows loud enough to follow.
