The Iron Teeth~
A heavy iron grate divides the passage like a row of rusted teeth. Faded
Midgaard inspection marks survive beneath green corrosion, but the stone
beyond belongs to the hollow now. Warm nesting musk leaks through the
bars, and something heavy occasionally brushes them from the far side.
~
