#3715
The Court of Gristlefang~
A sunken chamber has become a grotesque throne room. Torn bedding,
stolen purses, bent cutlery, bones, bright stones, and children's toys
form a mound beneath a cracked arch. Smaller rats keep the center clear
for Gristlefang, the scarred giant that rules the colony with the grim
certainty of a king who has never known another court.
~
