#3716
The Coldwater Collector~
Several narrow streams meet beside an old stone collector whose iron
ribs have gone green with age. The masonry here predates the nearby
brick drains, and every draft carries the mineral chill of deeper earth.
Northward, the floor falls toward a shaft that descends beneath even the
Darkwater Hollow.
~
