#3717
The Deepwell Descent~
Black water pours over the lip of a circular shaft beside an iron
ladder. Chisel marks in the surrounding stones are older than modern
Midgaard, and newer warning sigils have been scratched over them by
workers who wanted no part of what lies below. The ladder descends into
the Lower Underworks of Zone 38.
