The Broken Road Overlook~
The old westway ends where a landslide tore away the hillside. Far below,
the modern Western Highway can be glimpsed between trees, close enough
to recognize travelers but too far to reach from the shattered ledge.
Ancient road stones continue into the collapse, promising a connection
that will require the highway itself to be rebuilt before it is opened.
